@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v2
@managerEmail = admin@laprizza.pt
@managerPassword = LaPrizzaAdmin_013DI!
# Contas de desenvolvimento (AA06): npm run seed:dev-users -- --confirm com
# SEED_DEV_PASSWORD=LaPrizzaDev_013DI! (desde a AA06 não se criam contas com password por API).
@devPassword = LaPrizzaDev_013DI!
@fileName = manual.txt

# Documentos partilhados (SYS04): todas as roles leem; só o ADMINISTRATOR grava e remove.
# O admin@laprizza.pt é Administrator (seeder ou migração AA06).

### ==========================================
### 1: AUTENTICAÇÃO E PREPARAÇÃO
### ==========================================

### 1.1 Login do Manager (Seeder)
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{managerEmail}}",
  "password": "{{managerPassword}}"
}
?? status == 200

### Extração do Token do Manager
@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.accessToken}}

### 1.2 Login do Employee (conta employee@laprizza.pt do seed)
# @name loginEmployee
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "employee@laprizza.pt",
  "password": "{{devPassword}}"
}
?? status == 200

@employeeToken = {{loginEmployee.accessToken}}

### 1.3 Login do Customer (conta customer@laprizza.pt do seed)
# @name loginCustomer
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@laprizza.pt",
  "password": "{{devPassword}}"
}
?? status == 200

@customerToken = {{loginCustomer.accessToken}}

### 1.4 Login do Manager sem Administrator (conta manager@laprizza.pt do seed)
# @name loginManager
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "manager@laprizza.pt",
  "password": "{{devPassword}}"
}
?? status == 200

@managerToken = {{loginManager.accessToken}}

### 1.6 DELETE Limpeza preventiva do ficheiro (204 ou 404 - sem asserção)
# Garante que o 2. cria um ficheiro novo (201) mesmo que uma execução anterior tenha parado a meio.
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/shared-resources/{{fileName}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### ==========================================
### 2: UPLOAD E VALIDAÇÕES (PUT)
### ==========================================

### 2. PUT Upload como Administrator, ficheiro novo (201 Created)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/shared-resources/{{fileName}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

Conteudo de teste
?? status == 201

### 2.1 PUT Upload do mesmo nome, substitui o ficheiro (200 OK)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/shared-resources/{{fileName}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

Conteudo atualizado
?? status == 200

### 2.2 PUT Extensão não permitida (400 Bad Request)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/shared-resources/script.exe
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

x
?? status == 400

### 2.3 PUT Upload como Employee (403 Forbidden - apenas Administrator)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/shared-resources/{{fileName}}
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

Conteudo de teste
?? status == 403

### 2.4 PUT Upload como Manager (403 Forbidden - SYS04: o Manager lê mas não grava)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/shared-resources/{{fileName}}
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

Conteudo de teste
?? status == 403


### ==========================================
### 3: LISTAGEM E DOWNLOAD (GET)
### ==========================================

### 3. GET Listar como Employee (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shared-resources
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}
?? status == 200

### 3.1 GET Listar como Manager (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shared-resources
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
?? status == 200

### 3.2 GET Listar como Customer (200 OK - o Customer lê os recursos partilhados)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shared-resources
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
?? status == 200

### 4. GET Download como Employee (200 OK - devolve o conteúdo atualizado no 2.1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shared-resources/{{fileName}}
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}
?? status == 200

### 4.1 GET Path traversal (400 Bad Request)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shared-resources/..%2F..%2Fetc%2Fpasswd
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}
?? status == 400

### 4.2 GET Download como Customer (200 OK - o Customer lê os recursos partilhados)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shared-resources/{{fileName}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
?? status == 200


### ==========================================
### 5: REMOÇÃO (DELETE)
### ==========================================

### 5. DELETE Como Employee (403 Forbidden - apenas Administrator)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/shared-resources/{{fileName}}
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}
?? status == 403

### 5.1 DELETE Como Administrator (204 No Content)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/shared-resources/{{fileName}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
?? status == 204


### ==========================================
### 6: CONSISTÊNCIA APÓS REMOVER
### ==========================================

### 6. GET Download do ficheiro removido (404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shared-resources/{{fileName}}
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}
?? status == 404


### ==========================================
### 7: AUTENTICAÇÃO (TOKEN EM FALTA OU INVÁLIDO)
### ==========================================

### 7. GET Listar sem token (401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shared-resources
?? status == 401

### 7.1 GET Com token inválido (401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shared-resources
Authorization: Bearer token_invalido
?? status == 401
